ier P5 releases without changing historical ledger or delta bytes\n\n## Custody and semantic gates\n\n- 101 active bundles / 273,690 authenticated raw bytes\n- exact P5-04 image ledger: 370/370 unique authenticated originals\n- exact part-scoped QP/MS evidence for every approved route\n- candidate isolation and foreign-family rejection remain fail-closed\n- P5-01 through P5-03 predecessor receipt replay: 7/7 artifacts match SHA-256 and byte length\n\n## Verification\n\n- P5-01 focused suite: 15/15\n- P5-02 focused suite: 16/16\n- P5-03 focused suite: 18/18\n- P5-04 focused suite: 12/12\n- future producer suite: 30/30\n- future harness suite: 27/27\n- explicit physical-corpus checks for P5-01, P5-02, P5-03, and P5-04: deterministic rebuild PASS and physical corpus authentication PASS\n- `git diff --check`: PASS\n\nCloses #1789","created_at":"2026-07-31T01:52:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T02:15:43Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T02:10:44Z","merged_at":"2026-07-31T02:10:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"f2dda36822cf6d5e9c3f42135d14cd67e9b9a025","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1795/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1795/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1795/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/76b8eab3f033e4274af6a37e68ee3594947f333d","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1789-p5-04-discrete-random-variables","ref":"task/1789-p5-04-discrete-random-variables","sha":"76b8eab3f033e4274af6a37e68ee3594947f333d","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.githu